      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1 style=\\\"color: #ff8c42\\\">PIMPMYPONY TXT2IMG — WILDCARDS</h1><p>PonyXL / Illustrious Text-to-Image with TagForge wildcards.</p><h2>🖥️ Civitai Model</h2><ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2628215\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">PimpMyPony - Real Anime</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2611135\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">PimpMyPony - InCase Style</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=1346446\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">PimpMyPony - Semi Real Anime</a></li>\\n</ul><p>The workflow ships with <code>ilustmix_v111.safetensors</code> — any Pony/Illustrious XL checkpoint works.</p><hr><h2>🎛️ AutoTag Node with Wildcards included</h2><p>Install it from ComfyUI Manager or clone the repo:</p><pre>cd ComfyUI/custom_nodes\\ngit clone https://github.com/huchukato/ComfyUI-TagForge.git</pre><p>✨ <b>Wildcard Sub-Selection</b> (a1111-sd-webui-tagcomplete style):</p><ul>\\n<li>Type <code>__</code> to see available wildcards</li>\\n<li>Select a wildcard with arrow keys and press Enter → inserts <code>__wildcard_name__</code></li>\\n<li>Auto-show options → immediately displays all options from that wildcard</li>\\n<li>Select an option and press Enter → replaces wildcard with chosen option</li>\\n<li>ESC → keeps inserted wildcard and closes options</li>\\n</ul><p>🌟 <b>Features</b></p><ul>\\n<li>Smart parsing: wildcards with complex paths (e.g. <code>__pmp/blwjob/blwjb__</code>)</li>\\n<li>Line-by-line options: each line in wildcard file becomes a separate option</li>\\n<li>Text overflow handling: long options truncated with hover expansion</li>\\n<li>Full compatibility with existing wildcard files and formats</li>\\n<li>Multiple sources: repository, ComfyUI/models and DynamicPrompts</li>\\n</ul><p><i>This extension is based on ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts.</i></p><hr><h2>📁 Manual Wildcard Setup (Optional)</h2><p>To use wildcards with Easy-Use you may need to copy the wildcards folder:</p><pre>cp -r /path/to/ComfyUI-TagForge/wildcards \\\\\\n    /path/to/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ComfyUI-Easy-Use/wildcards/</pre><p>Then <b>restart ComfyUI</b> to load the new wildcards.</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"width\":610.8006604687498,\"height\":1335.1830720312503}",
        ""
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "note_json": "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1 style=\\\"color: #ff8c42\\\">PIMPMYPONY TXT2IMG — WILDCARDS</h1><p>PonyXL / Illustrious Text-to-Image with TagForge wildcards.</p><h2>🖥️ Civitai Model</h2><ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2628215\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">PimpMyPony - Real Anime</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=2611135\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">PimpMyPony - InCase Style</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://civitai.com/models/1195827?modelVersionId=1346446\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">PimpMyPony - Semi Real Anime</a></li>\\n</ul><p>The workflow ships with <code>ilustmix_v111.safetensors</code> — any Pony/Illustrious XL checkpoint works.</p><hr><h2>🎛️ AutoTag Node with Wildcards included</h2><p>Install it from ComfyUI Manager or clone the repo:</p><pre>cd ComfyUI/custom_nodes\\ngit clone https://github.com/huchukato/ComfyUI-TagForge.git</pre><p>✨ <b>Wildcard Sub-Selection</b> (a1111-sd-webui-tagcomplete style):</p><ul>\\n<li>Type <code>__</code> to see available wildcards</li>\\n<li>Select a wildcard with arrow keys and press Enter → inserts <code>__wildcard_name__</code></li>\\n<li>Auto-show options → immediately displays all options from that wildcard</li>\\n<li>Select an option and press Enter → replaces wildcard with chosen option</li>\\n<li>ESC → keeps inserted wildcard and closes options</li>\\n</ul><p>🌟 <b>Features</b></p><ul>\\n<li>Smart parsing: wildcards with complex paths (e.g. <code>__pmp/blwjob/blwjb__</code>)</li>\\n<li>Line-by-line options: each line in wildcard file becomes a separate option</li>\\n<li>Text overflow handling: long options truncated with hover expansion</li>\\n<li>Full compatibility with existing wildcard files and formats</li>\\n<li>Multiple sources: repository, ComfyUI/models and DynamicPrompts</li>\\n</ul><p><i>This extension is based on Com